    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17463,
        "title": "Conditionals in functions",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148179,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When creating functions in games, we think about when and why we need conditional statements inside them.</p><p>For example, when the player takes damage, a function with a conditional decides if the player is still alive or if the game is over.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: lightblue;&#xA;   }&#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: #85C1E9;&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    color: #7c795d;&#xA;    font-family: 'Trocchi', serif;&#xA;    font-size: 45px;&#xA;    font-weight: normal;&#xA;    line-height: 48px;&#xA;    margin: 0;&#xA;    text-align: centre&#xA;   }&#xA;   #panel {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    padding: 12px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Tiny Arena&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div id=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;p&gt;Player Health: &lt;span id=&quot;health&quot;&gt;100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;takeDamage()&quot;&gt;Hit Player&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;message&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let health = 100;&#xA;   function takeDamage() {&#xA;    health -= 25;&#xA;    document.getElementById(&quot;health&quot;).innerHTML = health;&#xA;    if (health &lt;= 0) {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;message&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Game Over!&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;message&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Keep fighting!&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148180,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If a function’s <strong>output</strong> changes based on its <strong>input</strong>, we need a conditional. Which input makes the player get a bonus life?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"150\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"132\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkBonusLife\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score + \" /><text value=\"&quot; points earns a bonus life&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkBonusLife(\" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148181,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In this case, the <code>checkBonusLife()</code> function uses an if statement to check if a parameter is more than or equal to <code>1000</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score === 1000\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkBonusLife\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score + \" /><text value=\"&quot; points earns a bonus life&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkBonusLife(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkBonusLife(\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>score &gt;= 1000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148182,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Another way conditionals get used inside functions is when they need to compare two values. Code <code>13</code> to see the result.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"159\" endIndex=\"161\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isFaster\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerSpeed, enemySpeed\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerSpeed &gt; enemySpeed) { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerSpeed + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is faster than &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + enemySpeed); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isFaster(\" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148183,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Here, the <code>isFaster()</code> function uses an if statement to check if the first number is greater than the second.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"playerSpeed &gt;= 10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isFaster\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerSpeed, enemySpeed\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerSpeed &gt; enemySpeed) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerSpeed + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is faster than &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + enemySpeed);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isFaster(\" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>playerSpeed &gt; enemySpeed</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148184,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If we want to provide output for the wrong input, we add an <code>else</code> statement to the function.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"92\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"startLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"code\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (code === \" /><text value=\"&quot;OPEN&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level starting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level locked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"startLevel(\" /><text value=\"&quot;WRONG&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148185,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When do we add a conditional statement inside a function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">When the function's behavior changes based on its parameters</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">When the function's behavior doesn't change based on its parameters</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">When the function's behavior changes based on its parameters.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148186,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which of the functions probably contains a conditional statement?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"isHealthLow(5);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showScore(5);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>isHealthLow()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>showScore()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>isHealthLow()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148187,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which function probably does <strong>not</strong> contain a conditional statement?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"isEnemyCloser(13,10);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isSameTile(25,20);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayTotalCoins(100,200);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>displayTotalCoins()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>isSameTile()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>displayTotalCoins()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148188,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How do we figure out how many values we need to pass as arguments to this function?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isFaster\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerSpeed, enemySpeed\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerSpeed &gt; enemySpeed) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerSpeed + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is faster than &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + enemySpeed);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">By checking how many parameters the conditional statement needs</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">By checking how many values we have available</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">By checking how many parameters the conditional statement needs.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148189,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isFaster\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerSpeed, enemySpeed\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerSpeed &gt; enemySpeed) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerSpeed + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is faster&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerSpeed + \" /><text value=\"&quot; isn't faster&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isFaster(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10 isn't faster</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>20 is faster</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10 isn't faster</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148190,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pass an argument (a value) to the function call such that the code inside the <code>if</code> statement runs.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"999\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"129\" endIndex=\"133\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"awardBonusLife\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score + \" /><text value=\"&quot; points earned a bonus life&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"awardBonusLife(\" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148191,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Run the code inside the function's <code>if</code> statement by coding the correct value.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"126\" endIndex=\"127\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"unlockTutorial\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tutorial unlocked at level &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + level);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"unlockTutorial(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148192,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Run the code block of the <code>if</code> statement by coding the value in the function call that evaluates the condition as true.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"16\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"44\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"193\" endIndex=\"195\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkEnoughCoins\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerCoins, itemCost\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerCoins &gt;= itemCost) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerCoins + \" /><text value=\"&quot; coins is enough to buy an item costing &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + itemCost);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkEnoughCoins(\" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148193,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Execute the first display statement by coding the right operator.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkSameLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"currentLevel, targetLevel\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (currentLevel === targetLevel) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Levels match&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Levels don't match&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkSameLevel(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148194,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Display <code>Level locked</code> in the console by coding the correct function call.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;OPEN&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"142\" /><option startIndex=\"142\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option startIndex=\"149\" endIndex=\"150\" /><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"151\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"startLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"code\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (code === \" /><text value=\"&quot;OPEN&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level starting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level locked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"startLevel(\" /><text value=\"&quot;WRONG&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>startLevel</code> followed by <code>(</code> and then <code>\"WRONG\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}